y", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25707648368917091", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28987085187640043"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1538759150540977"}]}, "change_log": "1. Added support for MV-HEVC decoding and playback. \r\n2. Added support for Dolby Vision Profile 7 (FEL). \r\n3. Added support for WeTrakr. \r\n4. Added support for Silo Media Server. \r\n5. Added support for Artwork Color themes. \r\n6. Added immersive playback modes for Cinema and Theater environments. \r\n7. Improved interaction with original disc menus. \r\n8. Optimized Seek Preview performance. \r\n9. Improved cleanup of invalid metadata. \r\n10. Fixed an issue causing incorrect information to be displayed in the HUD.", "created_date": 1795536919, "id": "28987085187640043", "version": "1.1.3", "version_code": 202611242, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25707648368917091", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28987085187640043"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1538759150540977"}]}, "change_log": "1. Added support for MV-HEVC decoding and playback.\r\n2. Added support for Dolby Vision Profile 7 (FEL).\r\n3. Added support for WeTrakr.\r\n4. Added support for Silo Media Server.\r\n5. Added support for Artwork Color themes.\r\n6. Added immersive playback modes for Cinema and Theater environments.\r\n7. Improved interaction with original disc menus.\r\n8. Optimized Seek Preview performance.\r\n9. Improved cleanup of invalid metadata.\r\n10. Fixed an issue causing incorrect information to be displayed in the HUD.", "created_date": 1795507420, "id": "28982752021406693", "version": "1.1.3", "version_code": 202611241, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25707648368917091", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28987085187640043"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1538759150540977"}]}, "change_log": "1. Added support for the SFTP protocol.\r\n2. Added support for VC-1, H.266/VVC, and other video codecs.\r\n3. Added support for multiple rating systems.\r\n4. Added support for custom Danmaku APIs.\r\n5. Added an option to view subscription status and access permissions.\r\n6. Fixed potential out-of-memory (OOM) crashes.\r\n7. Fixed an issue where 3D mode could be enabled unexpectedly when entering immersive playback.\r\n8. Improved the show/hide behavior of playback controls in immersive mode.", "created_date": 1793188324, "id": "28613269945021571", "version": "1.1.2", "version_code": 202610281, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25707648368917091", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28987085187640043"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1538759150540977"}]}, "ch